WEBVTT

00:00.440 --> 00:01.800
Have the volunteers

00:01.880 --> 00:03.240
Camp outside the city for now

00:03.320 --> 00:04.640
Your Highness

00:04.720 --> 00:06.120
This is cautious

00:06.720 --> 00:08.387
But may chill their hearts

00:10.160 --> 00:11.560
Look at their flags

00:12.040 --> 00:13.707
There are several fortresses alone

00:14.800 --> 00:16.467
This is a mixed bag

00:16.760 --> 00:19.093
Can't guarantee there are no Wuzhao spies

00:19.480 --> 00:21.560
They only need to organize a hundred people

00:21.640 --> 00:23.640
To cause chaos in the city

00:23.760 --> 00:25.160
Then seize the gates

00:25.960 --> 00:27.360
And we're finished

00:29.480 --> 00:30.840
What's the delay?

00:30.920 --> 00:31.760
Let us in

00:31.840 --> 00:33.840
Yes, yes, yes

00:34.160 --> 00:35.360
Brother-in-law

00:35.440 --> 00:36.480
These northern volunteers

00:36.560 --> 00:38.560
Are mostly bandits in daily life

00:39.040 --> 00:41.373
Their tempers are worse than each other

00:41.520 --> 00:42.920
Few are presentable

00:43.840 --> 00:45.360
If we don't reassure them

00:45.440 --> 00:47.400
They'll probably turn around and leave

